*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD file for {{ model }} with CUPS.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "{{ model.replace(' ', '') }}.ppd"
*DeviceID: "MFG:Canon;MDL:{{ model }};CMD:CANON;"
*Manufacturer: "Canon"
*Product: "({{ model }})"
*ModelName: "Canon {{ model }} Universal"
*ShortNickName: "Canon {{ model }}"
*NickName: "Canon {{ model }} - Universal Driver"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: {% if is_color %}True{% else %}False{% endif %}
*DefaultColorSpace: {% if is_color %}RGB{% else %}Gray{% endif %}
*VariablePaperSize: True
*HWMargins: 9 9 9 9

*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Canon;MDL:{{ model }};"
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 canonfilter"
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*cupsColorOrder: 0
*cupsColorSpace: {% if is_color %}1{% else %}0{% endif %}
*cupsBitsPerColor: 8
*cupsCompression: 0

*% Basic Page Sizes
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*% Resolution
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution {{ max_dpi }}dpi/{{ max_dpi }} dpi: "<</HWResolution[{{ max_dpi }} {{ max_dpi }}]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
